<title>JAPAN: Asahi Breweries -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Breweries -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		435.83		vs	  446.20</p>
<p> Operating	   32.05		vs	   31.81</p>
<p> Current	     18.17		vs	   12.54</p>
<p> Net		    4.08		vs	    3.80</p>
<p> EPS		    9.19 yen	  vs	    8.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    455 million	  vs	 422 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Breweries Ltd is a leading beer brewer.</p>
